	<section_number>58.1-3102</section_number>
	<catch_line>Jurisdiction of commissioners</catch_line>
	<text>
		The jurisdiction, powers and duties of commissioners shall not extend beyond the bounds of their respective counties or cities.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 58-854; 1984, c. 675.</history>
